<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/up $0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.75 higher. Trade active. Top $62.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-260 lbs     62.50-62.75</p>
<p>	   260-270 lbs     62.00-62.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     61.50-62.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     59.50-61.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     55.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows:   300-500  lbs steady; 500-550 lbs 1.00 higher; 550-700</p>
<p>lbs  2.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	47.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	48.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	49.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	50.00</p>
</text>
